cently, indicating weakness. By playing ♥A (which beats ♦K), I seize control while preserving ♣2 for a potential future decisive moment. This maximizes coordination with my teammate by positioning us to interrupt the landlord’s momentum.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": ["♥A"]}'}
